  "rationale": "The plant automaton G1 models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, capturing all possible sensor outcomes and motion commands as events. The specification E1 enforces safe and efficient exploration: it binds each perception outcome to a unique, safe, and progress-oriented controllable action, ensures obstacle recovery before resuming exploration, and prevents unsafe or oscillatory actions. Recovery is conservative but brief, always returning to forward progress as soon as the path is clear. All uncontrollable events are handled in every state, and only the allowed controllable is enabled per state.",
